new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..d86e20453e5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/changes/dev/14286.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fix incorrect TFCE scores in :func:`mne.stats.permutation_cluster_test`, :func:`mne.stats.permutation_cluster_1samp_test`, and related functions when using 1D data or non-unit threshold steps. The cluster extent was always counted as 1 for 1D data, and the per-threshold height contribution did not match the reference values, by `Antonio Elias`_.
